<title>USA: EPL Technologies Inc Q3 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>EPL Technologies Inc Q3 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>9 months ended	     3 months ended</p>
<p>		   September 30,		September 30,</p>
<p>		     1996	  1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Sales     $7,063,578   $1,164,025    $3,520,474    $ 588,446</p>
<p>Net (Loss) (1)</p>
<p>	   ( 3,313,217) ( 2,462,644)  ( 1,136,591)  (  808,726)</p>
<p>Net Loss/Common</p>
<p>Share (1)(2)</p>
<p>	   ( 3,561,574) ( 2,703,074)  ( 1,247,841)  (  888,476)</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>	     14,660,958    7,796,256    15,441,561    7,910,800</p>
<p>NOTES: (1) Includes material costs associated with sales support and scientific testing for commercial product development, particularly for processing aid field tests being conducted relating to the company's fresh apple, corn, onion and potato products and for development of the company's Respire brand in the film packaging segment of the business.</p>
<p>(2) After preferred stock dividends of $248,357 and $240,430 and $111,250 and $79,750 in the 1996 and 1995 third quarter and nine-month periods respectively.</p>
